message: "If you use this formalization, please cite the software using these metadata."
title: "Lean formalization of the fifth-order recurrences for OEIS A048590 and A048592"
type: software
version: "1.0.0"
authors:
  - family-names: Kabiri
    given-names: Taha
repository-code: "https://github.com/tahahhsr-code/pisot-ceiling-recurrences"
license: "Apache-2.0"
abstract: >-
  Lean 4 formal verification of the fifth-order recurrences for the original
  ceiling-defined Pisot sequences OEIS A048590 and A048592, for all natural
  indices at least six. Uses an elementary matrix and determinant argument.
  ChatGPT/Codex assistance is disclosed in AUTHORS.md. Does not formalize all
  results in separate manuscripts or claim independent human peer review.
keywords:
  - Lean 4
  - formal verification
  - Pisot sequences
  - OEIS A048590
  - OEIS A048592
  - linear recurrences
